{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2>Ourea is an impactful <strong>Adventure Puzzle</strong> game, with a focus on <strong>Cinematography</strong>. Play as the last of the Oreads and unravel the mysterious history of your people, as you traverse a <strong>story-rich</strong> environment.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Enviromental Puzzles</strong><br>Throughout the game, there are magical runes which can alter objects in different ways. Glyf can use these to complete puzzles and traverse the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250030/extras/2d5ec90b1e5e715651f6ebc497241e74.poster.avif?t=1595328353\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250030/extras/2d5ec90b1e5e715651f6ebc497241e74.webm?t=1595328353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250030/extras/2d5ec90b1e5e715651f6ebc497241e74.mp4?t=1595328353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><strong>Cinematic Shots</strong><br>We have put careful thought into the framing and composition of every scene. This \u202fwill\u202fhelp us tell the story through the environment, invoke emotions and create a complete cinematic game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250030/extras/c8fb01f3e88f5bfdaee8d1bbf89040d1.poster.avif?t=1595328353\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250030/extras/c8fb01f3e88f5bfdaee8d1bbf89040d1.webm?t=1595328353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250030/extras/c8fb01f3e88f5bfdaee8d1bbf89040d1.mp4?t=1595328353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><strong>Interactive World</strong><br>The world responds to the player's presence.\u202f As\u202f Glyf \u202fmoves\u202fthrough\u202fthe world,\u202f the\u202fenvironment\u202fwill\u202fchange and adapt\u202fto\u202fcreate an immersive experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250030/extras/58b10c6cbbc69db34c1fad6b2bfe8d51.poster.avif?t=1595328353\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250030/extras/58b10c6cbbc69db34c1fad6b2bfe8d51.webm?t=1595328353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250030/extras/58b10c6cbbc69db34c1fad6b2bfe8d51.mp4?t=1595328353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"b86085f39b187bfc49e11411a60058fa8490aaea.jpg","localized_name":"Heavyweight","name":"Heavyweight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1250030/b86085f39b187bfc49e11411a60058fa8490aaea.jpg"},{"icon":"6467f2306aeee9f43ad0e0f401751c955bba3c0f.jpg","localized_name":" Over Troubled Water","name":" Over Troubled Water","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1250030/6467f2306aeee9f43ad0e0f401751c955bba3c0f.jpg"},{"icon":"6f77620de8d9dc8d90d7a875338ea15fa8390908.jpg","localized_name":"Momentum","name":"Momentum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1250030/6f77620de8d9dc8d90d7a875338ea15fa8390908.jpg"},{"icon":"3866386ff0a34311b457190aa3289a69fa30a59c.jpg","localized_name":" A New Beginning","name":" A New Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1250030/3866386ff0a34311b457190aa3289a69fa30a59c.jpg"},{"icon":"bd144ff0d79ff4